flowchart LR
    DEV[Developer commit] --> GH[GitHub repository]

    GH --> CI[Status-Page Secure CI]
    CI --> V[Validate source + renderer]
    V --> BUILD[Build container]
    BUILD --> TRIVY[Trivy report +\nfail-closed CRITICAL gate]
    TRIVY --> SBOM[CycloneDX SBOM]
    SBOM --> OIDC[GitHub OIDC -> AWS STS]
    OIDC --> ECR[Immutable ECR image\ngit-<commit>]
    ECR --> DIGEST[Resolve sha256 digest]

    DIGEST --> GUARD[Guarded GitOps update]
    GH -. newer source check .-> GUARD
    GUARD -->|safe| GITOPS[gitops/eks-dev/kustomization.yaml]
    GUARD -->|stale non-GitOps source| STOP[Fail closed]

    GITOPS --> ARGO[Argo CD]
    ARGO --> PRESYNC[PreSync migration Job]
    PRESYNC --> EKS[Status-Page rollout on EKS]

    EKS --> VERIFY[Final acceptance:\nGit digest == runtime digest]

    TFCI[Terraform CI\ndev + eks-dev] --> TFV[fmt / init -backend=false / validate]
    GH --> TFCI

    note1[CI has ECR delivery rights\nand no EKS deployment rights]
    CI -. trust boundary .-> note1
